list.item:
Complex of ALCM-related issues: 
                            —

Whether to establish a management regime for ALCMs and, if so, how
                                the regime would work;
                            —

Elimination of ALCMs and other heavy bomber armaments during
                                elimination of heavy bombers;
                            —

ALCM distinguishibility;
                            —

Ban on non-nuclear ALCMs with multiple weapons;
                            —

 Definition issues including flight test and deployment
                                descriptions;
                            —

ALCM-associated inspection regime.
